# MUI Theme & Styling Rules

## Theme Architecture

The theme extends react-admin's `defaultTheme` at `apps/admin/src/theme.ts`.

### Color Token Reference

Use these tokens via the `sx` prop or `useTheme()` hook — never hardcode hex values:

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| `primary.main` | #c44520 | Buttons, active states, key accents |
| `primary.light` | #d86a4a | Hover states, lighter accents |
| `primary.dark` | #8a3016 | Pressed states, gradient endpoints |
| `secondary.main` | #dca310 | Gold highlights, secondary actions |
| `secondary.light` | #e6b840 | Hover states for secondary |
| `secondary.dark` | #9a720b | Pressed states for secondary |
| `background.default` | #fdf8f4 | Page background (warm cream) |
| `background.paper` | #ffffff | Card/surface background |
| `text.primary` | #2d2d2d | Headings, body text |
| `text.secondary` | #666666 | Supporting text, labels |

### Spacing System

MUI uses 8px base spacing. Use the `sx` shorthand:
- `p: 1` = 8px, `p: 2` = 16px, `p: 3` = 24px
- Maintain consistent spacing: 8/16/24/32/48px
- Cards: `p: 2` or `p: 3` internal padding
- Page content: `p: 3` (24px) as main padding

### Elevation & Borders

- Cards: use `elevation={1}` or `variant="outlined"` — never both
- Active sidebar items: `borderLeft: '4px solid'` + `bgcolor: rgba(196,69,32,0.08)`
- Drawer paper: `borderRight: '1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08)'`

### Gradient Usage

The project uses gradients sparingly:
- AppBar: `linear-gradient(135deg, #c44520 0%, #8a3016 100%)`
- Primary buttons: `linear-gradient(135deg, #c44520 0%, #d86a4a 100%)`
- Avoid gradients on other elements unless specifically requested

## Styling Best Practices

### Use `sx` prop (preferred)
```tsx
<Box sx={{ p: 2, bgcolor: 'background.paper', borderRadius: 1 }}>
```

### Use `styled()` for reusable components
```tsx
import { styled } from '@mui/material/styles';
const StyledCard = styled(Card)(({ theme }) => ({
  padding: theme.spacing(2),
  borderRadius: theme.shape.borderRadius,
}));
```

### Theme-Aware Responsive
```tsx
<Box sx={{
  display: 'flex',
  flexDirection: { xs: 'column', md: 'row' },
  gap: { xs: 2, md: 3 },
}}>
```

## Component Customization

When customizing MUI components globally, add to the `components` key in `theme.ts`:

```tsx
components: {
  MuiComponentName: {
    styleOverrides: {
      root: { /* styles */ },
    },
    defaultProps: { /* default prop values */ },
  },
}
```

## Status Colors

Use semantic colors for states:
- Success: `success.main` (#2e7d32) — 完成, 活跃, 正常
- Error: `error.main` (#d32f2f) — 失败, 错误, 停用
- Warning: `warning.main` (#ed6c02) — 待处理, 警告
- Info: `info.main` (#0288d1) — 信息, 提示
